1
00:00:01,166 --> 00:00:03,791
Part One: Moisturizer

2
00:00:06,125 --> 00:00:08,916
To mitigate the effect of damage to the skin,

3
00:00:08,916 --> 00:00:11,500
apply moisturizer twice a day,

4
00:00:11,500 --> 00:00:13,916
once in the morning and once at night

5
00:00:14,416 --> 00:00:17,083
to all areas of the neck- front and back,

6
00:00:17,458 --> 00:00:20,250
the skin surrounding the mouth, the face, 

7
00:00:20,250 --> 00:00:23,625
and the upper portions of the chest above  your collarbone. 

8
00:00:23,625 --> 00:00:28,791
What this cream does is create a film 
over your skin that acts like armor.

9
00:00:28,791 --> 00:00:33,000
This armor prevents further skin dermatitis from accumulating.

10
00:00:33,458 --> 00:00:38,041
The only time to not apply moisturizer is right before your treatment.

11
00:00:38,375 --> 00:00:40,541
It ensures that the head and neck mask that 

12
00:00:40,541 --> 00:00:43,375
you wear during treatment remains clean.

13
00:00:43,791 --> 00:00:49,000
You can apply moisturizer before your treatment
if it is well before your appointment,

14
00:00:49,000 --> 00:00:52,958
and you can apply moisturizer
immediately after treatment.
